      (i) The sale of or charges for stationary two-way radio services, telegraph services, teletypewriter services, and teleconferencing services. The sale or charges described in this sub-subparagraph shall not be considered sales of private communication services as defined in § 47-2001(n)(1)(G)(iv) ;
      (ii) The sale of or charges for “900”, “976”, “915”, and other “900”-type telecommunication services;
